<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;Could the location of the modules be an issue here as I've added &lt;c&gt;use lib '.';&lt;/c&gt;?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yes, definitely, don't rely on the CWD either when running from &lt;c&gt;cron&lt;/c&gt;, use an absolute path. Also, BTW, you can see what Perl is outputting by appending e.g. &lt;c&gt;2&gt;/tmp/stderr&lt;/c&gt; to the &lt;c&gt;crontab&lt;/c&gt; entry.&lt;/p&gt;
